{"config":{"lang":["fr"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"],"fields":{"title":{"boost":1000.0},"text":{"boost":1.0},"tags":{"boost":1000000.0}}},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"Home","text":"Num\u00e9rique et Sciences Informatiques Premi\u00e8re COURS Chapitres 1 \u00e0 14 D\u00c9FIS D\u00e9fis, challenges \u00c9PREUVE PRATIQUE Sujets + ZIP + corrig\u00e9s SUJETS BAC \u00c9nonc\u00e9s + corrections (PDF)"},{"location":"cours/","title":"Sommaire du cours","text":"<p>Choisis un chapitre dans le menu \u00e0 gauche.</p>"},{"location":"cours/chap01_ordinateur/","title":"chap01_ordinateur","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap01_ordinateur/activites/","title":"activites","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap01_ordinateur/cours/","title":"cours","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap01_ordinateur/exercices/","title":"exercices","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap01_ordinateur/prerequis/","title":"prerequis","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap02_programmer/","title":"chap02_programmer","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap02_programmer/activites/","title":"activites","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap02_programmer/cours/","title":"cours","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap02_programmer/exercices/","title":"exercices","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap02_programmer/prerequis/","title":"prerequis","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap03_interaction/","title":"chap03_interaction","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap03_interaction/activites/","title":"activites","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap03_interaction/cours/","title":"cours","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap03_interaction/exercices/","title":"exercices","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap03_interaction/prerequis/","title":"prerequis","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap04_types_structures/","title":"chap04_types_structures","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap04_types_structures/activites/","title":"activites","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap04_types_structures/cours/","title":"cours","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap04_types_structures/exercices/","title":"exercices","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap04_types_structures/prerequis/","title":"prerequis","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap05_tableaux/","title":"chap05_tableaux","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap05_tableaux/activites/","title":"activites","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap05_tableaux/cours/","title":"cours","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap05_tableaux/exercices/","title":"exercices","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap05_tableaux/prerequis/","title":"prerequis","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap06_trier_chercher/","title":"Accueil","text":"<p>En fran\u00e7ais comme en anglais, trier (sorting) signifie \u00ab r\u00e9partir en plusieurs  classes \u00bb. </p> <p>La d\u00e9finition informatique est cependant plus pr\u00e9cise : elle impose que les \u00e9l\u00e9ments soient ordonn\u00e9s par ordre croissant ou d\u00e9croissant. </p> <p>Ce chapitre aborde les deux ordres les plus courants, \u00e0 savoir l\u2019ordre usuel pour les nombres r\u00e9els (1 &lt; 2.5 &lt; 4.3\u2026)et l\u2019ordre du dictionnaire ('a' &lt; 'abc' &lt; 'ad' &lt; 'b') pour les cha\u00eenes de caract\u00e8res.</p> <p>Ce chapitre montre l\u2019int\u00e9r\u00eat de trier un tableau en comparant l\u2019efficacit\u00e9 des recherches lin\u00e9aire et dichotomique. Puis il pr\u00e9sente deux algorithmes de tri :    - le tri par insertion    - le tri par s\u00e9lection. </p> <p>Enfin, la terminaison et la complexit\u00e9 (dans le pire cas) de ces algorithmes sont prouv\u00e9es rigoureusement.</p>"},{"location":"cours/chap06_trier_chercher/activites/","title":"activites","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap06_trier_chercher/cours/","title":"cours","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap06_trier_chercher/exercices/","title":"exercices","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap06_trier_chercher/prerequis/","title":"Pr\u00e9requis \u2013 Trier et chercher dans les tableaux","text":"<p>Ce QCM permet de v\u00e9rifier les connaissances n\u00e9cessaires avant d\u2019aborder les algorithmes de tri et de recherche.</p>"},{"location":"cours/chap06_trier_chercher/prerequis/#qcm","title":"QCM","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap06_trier_chercher/prerequis/#1-selectionner-les-affirmations-correctes","title":"1. S\u00e9lectionner les affirmations correctes.","text":"<p>a) Pour calculer les indices des valeurs minimales d\u2019un tableau <code>t</code>, on va utiliser une boucle <code>for x in t</code> plut\u00f4t qu\u2019une boucle <code>for i in range(len(t))</code>.</p> <p>b) Calculer un maximum est plus co\u00fbteux que calculer un minimum.</p> Corrig\u00e9  - \u2705 **a)** Vrai : for x in ... va \u00eatre plus efficace - \u274c **b)** Faux : calculer un maximum ou un minimum a le **m\u00eame co\u00fbt** (une comparaison par \u00e9l\u00e9ment)."},{"location":"cours/chap06_trier_chercher/prerequis/#2-que-vaut-la-somme-1-2-n","title":"2. Que vaut la somme 1 + 2 + \u2026 + n ?","text":"<p>a) n(n + 1)  </p> <p>b) n(n + 1) / 2  </p> <p>c) n(n - 1) / 2  </p> Corrig\u00e9  \u2705 **b)** La somme des entiers de 1 \u00e0 n vaut   n(n + 1) / 2."},{"location":"cours/chap06_trier_chercher/prerequis/#3-quaffichent-les-programmes-suivants","title":"3. Qu\u2019affichent les programmes suivants ?","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap06_trier_chercher/prerequis/#a-range-avec-valeur-initiale","title":"a) Range avec valeur initiale","text":"<pre><code>for i in range(4, 10):\n    print(i)\n</code></pre> Corrig\u00e9  Affiche les entiers de 4 \u00e0 9 :   <pre><code>4\n5\n6\n7\n8\n9\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"cours/chap06_trier_chercher/prerequis/#b-range-avec-valeur-initiale-et-pas","title":"b) Range avec valeur initiale et pas","text":"<pre><code>for i in range(10, 4, -1):\n    print(i)\n</code></pre> Corrig\u00e9  Affiche les entiers de 10 \u00e0 5 en ordre d\u00e9croissant :   <pre><code>10\n9\n8\n7\n6\n5\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"cours/chap06_trier_chercher/prerequis/#c-boucles-imbriquees","title":"c) Boucles imbriqu\u00e9es","text":"<pre><code>for i in range(3):\n    for j in range(2):\n        print(i, j)\n</code></pre> Corrig\u00e9  Toutes les combinaisons de `i` et `j` :   <pre><code>0 0\n0 1\n1 0\n1 1\n2 0\n2 1\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"cours/chap06_trier_chercher/prerequis/#d-tableau-de-comparaisons","title":"d) Tableau de comparaisons","text":"<pre><code>t = [2 &lt; 5 // 2, 'A' &lt; 'a', 'ab' &lt;= 'a']\nprint(t)\n</code></pre> Corrig\u00e9  - `5 // 2 = 2`, donc `2 &lt; 2` \u2192 False   - `'A' &lt; 'a'` \u2192 True (ordre lexicographique ASCII)   - `'ab' &lt;= 'a'` \u2192 False    Affichage :   <pre><code>[False, True, False]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"cours/chap06_trier_chercher/prerequis/#e-enumerer-un-tableau","title":"e) \u00c9num\u00e9rer un tableau","text":"<pre><code>for i, x in enumerate(['C', 'A']):\n    print(i, x.lower())\n</code></pre> Corrig\u00e9 <pre><code>0 c\n1 a\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"cours/chap06_trier_chercher/prerequis/#f-construire-un-tableau-par-comprehension","title":"f) Construire un tableau par compr\u00e9hension","text":"<pre><code>print([x.lower() for x in ['C', 'Ab']])\n</code></pre> Corrig\u00e9 <pre><code>['c', 'ab']\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"cours/chap06_trier_chercher/prerequis/#4-comment-echanger-les-valeurs-des-variables-a-et-b-en-python","title":"4. Comment \u00e9changer les valeurs des variables <code>a</code> et <code>b</code> en Python ?","text":"<p>a) <code>swap(a, b)</code> </p> <p>b) <code>a, b = b, a</code> </p> <p>c) <code>a = b ; b = a</code> </p> Corrig\u00e9  \u2705 **b)** Python permet l\u2019\u00e9change direct gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 l\u2019affectation multiple.   Les autres propositions sont incorrectes."},{"location":"cours/chap07_donnees_tables/","title":"chap07_donnees_tables","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap07_donnees_tables/activites/","title":"activites","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap07_donnees_tables/cours/","title":"cours","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap07_donnees_tables/exercices/","title":"exercices","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap07_donnees_tables/prerequis/","title":"prerequis","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap08_specifier_tester/","title":"chap08_specifier_tester","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap08_specifier_tester/activites/","title":"activites","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap08_specifier_tester/cours/","title":"cours","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap08_specifier_tester/exercices/","title":"exercices","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap08_specifier_tester/prerequis/","title":"prerequis","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap09_bits_donnees/","title":"chap09_bits_donnees","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap09_bits_donnees/activites/","title":"activites","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap09_bits_donnees/cours/","title":"cours","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap09_bits_donnees/exercices/","title":"exercices","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap09_bits_donnees/prerequis/","title":"prerequis","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap10_reseaux/","title":"chap10_reseaux","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap10_reseaux/activites/","title":"activites","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap10_reseaux/cours/","title":"cours","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap10_reseaux/exercices/","title":"exercices","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap10_reseaux/prerequis/","title":"prerequis","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap11_web/","title":"chap11_web","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap11_web/activites/","title":"activites","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap11_web/cours/","title":"cours","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap11_web/exercices/","title":"exercices","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap11_web/prerequis/","title":"prerequis","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap12_systemes_peripheriques/","title":"chap12_systemes_peripheriques","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap12_systemes_peripheriques/activites/","title":"activites","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap12_systemes_peripheriques/cours/","title":"cours","text":""},{"location":"cours/chap12_systemes_peripheriques/exercices/","title":"exercices","text":""},{"location":"cou